Bits.Description:
Core count code. Base-2 logarithm of the build parameter PARA_CORE_NUM, the number of parallel ChaCha cores.

Usage: Read once at initialisation for performance planning.

Values:
0x0 one core (reset value);
0x1 two cores;
0x2 four cores;
0x3 eight cores.

Unit: none

Limits: Two bits used; values above 0x3 are not produced.

Data width code. Encodes the build parameter PARA_AXI_DW, the width of the AXI4 data window.

Usage: Read once at initialisation to size bursts and watermarks.

Values:
0x0 32 bits (reset value);
0x1 64 bits;
0x2 128 bits;
0x3 256 bits.

Unit: none

Limits: Two-bit constant.
